<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 9.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 9.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>			    Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield     Close</p>
<p> 1 Prime Credit Tr	 10.21    0.96</p>
<p> 2 McIntosh Sec	    10.00    0.90</p>
<p> 3 Indu Property	    9.78    0.93</p>
<p> 4 Prop Income Inv	  9.68    1.05</p>
<p> 5 BT Prop Trust	    9.49    1.72</p>
<p> 6 Villa World		9.24    1.19</p>
<p> 7 Colonial Mutual	  9.20    1.15</p>
<p> 8 Central Equity	   9.00    1.00</p>
<p> 9 Equitilink		 8.93    0.56</p>
<p>10 Aust Tour		  8.93    0.84</p>
<p>11 Centro Prop		8.74    2.23</p>
<p>12 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.67    0.90</p>
<p>13 Advance Pro CB	   8.47    1.37</p>
<p>14 Westpac Prop Tr	  8.42    1.61</p>
<p>15 Barclays Mirvac	  8.40    1.31</p>
<p>16 Armstrong Retail	 8.35    0.79</p>
